      "path": "packages/excalidraw/actions/actionProperties.tsx",
      "action": "edit",
      "phase": "codegen",
      "behaviour": "New undoable changeArrowheadSize action with a small/medium/large RadioSelection, also rendered in the compact arrow-properties popover.",
      "rules": [
        "1. `export const actionChangeArrowheadSize = register<ArrowheadSize>({ name: \"changeArrowheadSize\", label: \"labels.arrowheadSize\", trackEvent: false, ... })`.",
        "2. perform: invariant(value, \"actionChangeArrowheadSize: value must be defined\"); changeProperty over the elements: a linear element becomes newElementWith(el, { arrowheadSize: value }), and an elbow arrow is then re-routed with updateElbowArrowRoute exactly as actionChangeArrowhead does; other elements are returned as is. The picked key is stored as is (medium stores \"medium\").",
        "3. perform returns appState `{ ...appState, currentItemArrowheadSize: value }` and captureUpdate CaptureUpdateAction.IMMEDIATELY.",
        "4. PanelComponent: a fieldset with legend t(\"labels.arrowheadSize\") and a `buttonList` div holding RadioSelection<ArrowheadSize> group \"arrowhead-size\" with options small/medium/large: text t(\"labels.small\"|\"labels.medium\"|\"labels.large\"), icon FontSizeSmallIcon/FontSizeMediumIcon/FontSizeLargeIcon, testId \"arrowheadSize-small\"|\"arrowheadSize-medium\"|\"arrowheadSize-large\"; onChange calls updateData(value).",
        "5. Its value is getFormValue<ArrowheadSize | null>(elements, app, getValue, predicate, default) where getValue reads `element.arrowheadSize ?? \"medium\"` for a linear element (else appState.currentItemArrowheadSize ?? \"medium\"), predicate is isLinearElement, and default is `hasSelection ? null : appState.currentItemArrowheadSize ?? \"medium\"`.",
        "6. actionChangeArrowProperties renders renderAction(\"changeArrowheadSize\") right after renderAction(\"changeArrowhead\")."
      ],
      "exports": [
        {
          "name": "actionChangeArrowheadSize",
          "kind": "const",
          "params": [],
          "returns": "Action<ArrowheadSize>"
        }
